                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While the pixel art of the world and the drawn art style of the monsters reminds me a LOT of the Original OFF, The story is very unique sand pretty engaging. The game was challenging at points, but that's more so because i never used any of the boss \"dregs\" to upgrade my health like i should have. (i thought there would be a secret ending involving them for some reason). All in all the worldbuilding is Solid, (Definitely going to play Soulscape to find out what happened to the dragons). The attack animations for each spell and weapon was unique and pretty fun to watch, Id say this game and the possible story afterwards are more then worth investing the time to play.",
